# astrion-skill v1
goal: Create a new dated journal entry note
trigger:
  - phrase: "journal"
  - phrase: "new journal entry"
  - phrase: "log my day"
do: |
  Create a new Notes app note titled "Journal — YYYY-MM-DD" (today's
  date). Pre-populate with three section headers: "What happened",
  "What I learned", "Tomorrow". Focus the cursor at the first section.
  Record a 'journal-entry' graph node so it shows in weekly digest.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 200
  reversibility: BOUNDED
